                <pb facs="0196" n="94" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg94"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/281.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Jay to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-08-10"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram July 21: Tsunejiro Miyaoka, councilor of embassy; Dr. Yoshizumi
                    Tahara, expert, home department; Tomoye Takagi, expert, government of Formosa,
                    have to-day been appointed commissioners.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
